      "category": "Text",
      "text": "Section 1. *Evaluation of Real Property*\u2014With a view to satisfying the requirements of the Real Property Tax Law as amended by the Laws of 1978, chapter 476, the Finance Department, the Tax Commission, and the Real Property Assessment Department, insofar as each has jurisdiction over real property assessments in the City, shall file all necessary applications with the appropriate State agencies and take any and all steps necessary to move toward physical revaluation of all real property within the boundaries of the City at 100 per cent of full value.",
